## Structure

Arrange → Act → Assert; one behavior per test.

```{{lang}}
{{aaa_example}}
```

## Assertions

- Assert exact values, error types/messages and emitted states.
- Never only `is not None` / `isNotNull`, never `assert True`, never a test without an assertion.
- Assert calls only at port boundaries, not inside the subject.

## Determinism

- Time: {{time_control}}
- Randomness: {{random_control}}
- Async/concurrency: {{async_control}}

## Behavior, not implementation

Refactoring the subject without changing behavior must not break the test.

